@startuml agentchannel-phase-reduction
' AgentChannel phase as a reduction of the bound Agent's phase, one trigger
' per edge. The Active set and the axes are the prose on
' docs/src/controller/reconcilers.md (Channel phase reduction).
!include _style.puml

state Active
state Degraded
state Failed
state Terminating
state "any phase" as Any #F5F5F5

[*] --> Active : Agent resolves
[*] --> Failed : Agent not found
Active --> Degraded : Agent Failed or Degraded
Degraded --> Active : Agent recovers
Active --> Failed : Agent deleted
Degraded --> Failed : Agent deleted
Failed --> Active : Agent recreated
Any --> Terminating : deleted
@enduml
